{"ts":"2026-08-29T23:32:54.495Z","seq":66,"src":"server","type":"note","stage":"Penciler","execution":"73d06837","message":"Pass 2. Pass 1 was in the right places and drawn badly, so this pass is almost all drawing: widen the far ear to its measured 107 right edge and seat it on the head, close every silhouette into one continuous chain, let the right ears run into the skull instead of being capped with a straight line, and replace the starburst grass, the bead-chain leaves and the ray-like whiskers with observed shapes. Also dropping Drawing.drawCompositionGrid and ruling the thirds by hand, because it paints pink power-point dots onto a sheet that is meant to be blue and graphite only."}
