{"ts":"2026-08-29T23:40:46.315Z","seq":86,"src":"server","type":"note","stage":"Critic","execution":"911e5fb8","message":"Refinement pass 1 against the ten defects. The structural move is back-to-front: each mass fills itself with the paper ground first and is then hatched, so a nearer mass occludes a farther one by construction rather than by an even-odd clip over self-intersecting contours. Value order is the reference Notan: trunk near-black, right rabbit mid-dark, left rabbit light, wash untouched. Light reads as coming from the upper front-left, so the shadow accents all go on the viewer-right of each mass."}
{"ts":"2026-08-29T23:40:46.530Z","seq":87,"src":"server","type":"render","stage":"Critic","execution":"911e5fb8","script":"scripts/0020.js","artifact":"artifacts/stage4_refined_v1.webp","format":"webp","bytes":153720}
