{"ts":"2026-08-29T23:42:59.832Z","seq":91,"src":"server","type":"note","stage":"Critic","execution":"23f94fdf","message":"Refinement pass 2. v1 held up structurally and failed on value: the whole image sat between 10 and 25 percent grey, so the trunk — the darkest mass in the reference — carried the same weight as fur. Deepening the trunk to near-black across four hatch directions, taking the right rabbit to a solid mid-dark with a core shadow down its viewer-right, and giving every ear an interior. The far ears concentric inner ellipse is deleted outright: it read as a second outline and made the ear look like a plate."}
