{"ts":"2026-08-29T23:46:28.265Z","seq":96,"src":"server","type":"note","stage":"Critic","execution":"3ccf4783","message":"Final render. Three changes over refined_v2: the right rabbit gets a fourth hatch direction and higher alphas so it sits clearly darker than the left, as the reference has it; the two right-hand stems are shortened and the third is detached so the group stops reading as a closed triangle; and the trunk region runs 16px lower with a soft foot pass so it does not end on a hard horizontal cut."}
